{title: Good Morning, Lord}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

verse 1
Each new morning, I wake to find You
You're the Guardian of my way, O Lord,
I've embraced Your awesome grace
I am born anew!

Verse 2
I'm reminded by rays of sunshine
You are my Guiding Light, O Lord,
Each new dawn reveals Your love
Glory be to You!

chorus
Grace to greet each morning
And Light to guide my way.
Walk with me each step, O Lord,
For this is what I ask and pray---.

Verse 3
In the ev'ning, I feel Your presence
As the stars begin to shine, O Lord.
Heav'n and earth declare to all:
You are Lord and King!

Verse 4
In the darkness, I'm not forsaken:
My soul can rest secure, O Lord,
'Til the dawn returns again
And I rise to sing!
